{"id":"603078","name":"波点馒头","author":"四月去看海","authorId":"11039065","desc":"","cover":"images/603078/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番薯叶","amount":"100克"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"400克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"6克"},{"name":"小苏打","amount":"2克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番薯叶洗净，沥水。","img":"images/603078/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加盐腌制一小时后，石舀捣碎。","img":"images/603078/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"挤出番薯叶汁。","img":"images/603078/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用面粉、番薯叶汁加水分别和两种面团。","img":"images/603078/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"白面团醒发两倍大，排气后擀长方形面片。","img":"images/603078/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"绿色面团醒发两倍后，排气擀长方形面片。","img":"images/603078/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用吸管在绿色面片上戳小孔。","img":"images/603078/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"刷上水。","img":"images/603078/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"两张面皮叠加。","img":"images/603078/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"卷面卷。","img":"images/603078/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"整形成馒头状。","img":"images/603078/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入蒸笼，水开后上锅蒸十分钟。","img":"images/603078/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"蒸好的波点馒头放入盘中。","img":"images/603078/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"夏日炎炎，有你超清爽。","img":"images/603078/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"也可用其它蔬菜汁制做不同颜色的波点馒头。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}